{"EmbedController#best sets X-Frame-Options to ALLOWALL, enabling framing from any origin and making embed page susceptible to clickjacking": 0.6918986439704895, "Posts imported via RSS/embedding use cook_method: raw_html which bypasses standard cooking pipeline and renders with raw post.cooked in embed view, with no sanitization applied to remote content before storage or rendering, creating XSS vulnerability": 0.9477823972702026, "New cook_method column and cook_methods enum in Post model with PostCreator propagating cook_method from options establishes raw HTML rendering path that bypasses cooking for all embedded content": 0.8976833820343018, "TopicRetriever implements host validation, retrieval throttling via Redis, and fallback to RSS polling - misconfig or race conditions could degrade behavior": 0.3151589632034302, "Inconsistent host validation: EmbedController#ensure_embeddable raises Discourse::InvalidAccess on referer host mismatch but then sets X-Frame-Options: ALLOWALL, while TopicRetriever#invalid_host? silently returns boolean without raising, creating potential access control gaps": 0.5749108195304871, "The disqus.thor task removed category option handling and now imports posts via TopicEmbed.import_remote, removing ability to specify category which is a behavioral contract change affecting existing workflows": 0.6724292039871216, "JavaScript postMessage in embed.html.erb uses document['body'].offsetHeight instead of standard document.body.offsetHeight, which may fail in some environments": 0.4683864414691925, "embeddable_host defaults to empty string in site_settings.yml, silently blocking embedding until configured and raising InvalidAccess rather than providing clear misconfiguration signal": 0.38215741515159607}